Package: slopd
Version: {version}
Architecture: {architecture}
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Lev Gorodetskii <slopworld@drsr.io>
Homepage: https://github.com/droserasprout/slopworld
Depends: bash, bat, bubblewrap, git, less, micro, passt, ripgrep, systemd, tmux (>= 3.7), slopctl, {shared_libraries}
Suggests: highlight, moor, procps, python3-pygments, rtkit
Description: Linux session daemon for SlopWorld coding agents
 Does not require RimWorld or the SlopWorld game client.
